  "limits": [
    "Emulator review, not hardware validation. Strict keep and combat30FPS gates still fail. Larger buffers restore more geometry; co-op scrolling misses219retraces versus181with the prior smaller buffers.",
    "Orchard combat still reports214 near-limit redraws with12bytes minimum world space. Open-stage packet pressure remains work; do not treat the castle fix as a complete command-capacity fix.",
    "Campaign UI validation uses supported stage skip, not full battle playthroughs. Separate combat and castle-entry probes use real legal actions.",
    "Initial campaign probe reported a validation failure despite the expected marker in its final log; its shell source had been edited while it was running. The same artifacts were retested with a stable script in campaign-final; all functional checks passed before the known FPS gate failed."
